[{"title":"晓妆","author":"林维丞","text":"轻移莲步倚妆楼，十二珠帘乍上钩。\n洗却昨宵旧脂粉，簪花无力倩丫头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5078,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梅窗","author":"林维丞","text":"几生修到话知心，香气当窗脉脉侵。\n最好碧纱笼月影，孤山画稿静中寻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5079,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"香唾","author":"林维丞","text":"别传香唾亦奇谈，侍女犹誇气味甘。\n持比名花新破萼，露珠点点口轻含。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5080,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"隙溪吐墨","author":"林维丞","text":"门外溪光漾一奁，浓痕隐约水痕黏。\n临流错认南宫画，泼墨云山扫笔尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5081,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野和尚","author":"林维丞","text":"不翻贝叶混尘凡，无限情根尚未芟。\n博得当门弥勒笑，酒香花气满僧衫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5082,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吟坛老将","author":"林维丞","text":"久排大阵压吟场，横扫诗魔意气扬。\n此即冠军真老手，一枝健笔捣三唐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5083,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"刘宠选钱","author":"林鹏霄","text":"临歧曲已唱骊驹，太守清廉世所无。\n笑煞宦途贪墨辈，一钱如命较锱铢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5084,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潜园探梅","author":"林鹏霄","text":"行尽长桥与短桥，名园览胜值花朝。\n逋仙去后寒香在，多少春光慰寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5085,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孕妇","author":"林鹏霄","text":"乾坤混沌一时包，消息传来十月交。\n试较红罗旧裙带，柳腰合抱是谁教。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5086,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"李谪仙醉草清平调","author":"林鹏霄","text":"谱出清平雅调和，谪仙醉态喜高歌。\n名花自古能倾国，不是狂言醉后多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5087,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老妓","author":"林鹏霄","text":"空馀白发对妆楼，一曲琵琶一曲愁。\n回首五陵年少客，而今谁与数缠头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5088,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"八阵图","author":"林鹏霄","text":"为恨东吴未肯降，图开八阵妙无双。\n先生不尽安排意，白帝城南石沉江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5089,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮书怀 其一","author":"查元鼎","text":"竞争得失笑鸡虫，溷迹东瀛岁又终。\n处世莫如穷耐久，浇愁除却酒无功。\n英雄识字犹馀事，妻子号寒尚古风。\n天与豪情天不薄，休将头脑学冬烘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5090,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁暮书怀 其二","author":"查元鼎","text":"明月清风不值钱，客中消受亦神仙。\n俗尘扑面祛千斛，老屋打头寄一椽。\n自有啸歌惊户外，漫愁车马冷门前。\n悠悠世事无凭准，屈子何须更问天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5091,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十初度 其一","author":"查元鼎","text":"于今五十犹如此，便到百年已可知。\n况是身家羁逆旅，恰逢王国用征师。\n远游岂惮重洋险，大厦难为一木支。\n草色缘阶删不尽，伥伥行又欲何之。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5092,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十初度 其二","author":"查元鼎","text":"富春江上客星孤，故国田园久已芜。\n欲报劬劳因负米，谁怜辛苦引群雏。\n鳌牵瀛海心原壮，书上秦庭计太迂。\n纵是昨非知伯玉，发添斑白叹头颅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5093,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十初度 其三","author":"查元鼎","text":"身世浑如不系舟，绝裾温峤悔遨游。\n功名误尽文章贱，富贵交贻妻妾羞。\n蝶梦方酣争得鹿，鹊巢初筑让鸣鸠。\n穷途赖有英豪气，高卧元龙百尺楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5094,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五十初度 其四","author":"查元鼎","text":"菊英介寿晋芳樽，篱下秋光一样繁。\n出岫云情怜客意，始衰镜影画诗魂。\n其何能淑身将隐，无易由言舌莫扪。\n敢道艾年当服政，寻常显晦不须论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5095,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和区天民游剑潭","author":"查元鼎","text":"寒潭谁掷剑，终古化龙腾。\n长忆凌霄客，而无咒钵僧。\n虹藏江弄影，光耀水生棱。\n空际盘旋舞，秒波分外澄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5096,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"妓女出家","author":"曾逢辰","text":"愤剪青青七尺丝，双眉不展学低眉。\n相逢笑杀缠头客，掩口低声唤布施。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5097,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"韩蕲王骑驴","author":"曾逢辰","text":"残山剩水任徘徊，驴背甘心老将才。\n应有鞭长难及恨，不能亲见两宫回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5098,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白桃花","author":"曾逢辰","text":"别遣幽情到小园，靓妆相对淡无言。\n玄都今亦繁华尽，风月庭中总断魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5099,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中宗点筹","author":"曾逢辰","text":"为藉樗蒲计暗张，点筹庸主事堪伤。\n江山自有输赢局，曾否深宫一较量。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5100,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"白菊","author":"曾逢辰","text":"红紫何堪结赏音，爱将秋色静中寻。\n漫嫌雅淡难谐俗，三径归来證素心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5101,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宋梅","author":"曾逢辰","text":"胜地寻香感慨深，古祠零落树阴阴。\n可怜炎宋繁华尽，不及梅花冷到今。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5102,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"剖蚝篇有引","author":"曾逢辰","text":"生不识珠玑艳绮罗香，红妆窈窕誇姬姜。\n又不愿郁金裙缠头锦，送客留髡长夜饮。\n但爱蚝肥孕珠胎，随月圆腻著手开。\n琼浆玉屑软于苔，盈筐盈筥肩归来。\n吁嗟乎，蚝石触侬鞋，蚝房刺侬手。\n海水湿衣裳，海飞吹罶。\n磨蝎入身宫，于心亦何咎。\n君不见挂帆拾海月，才士风流今未绝。\n又不见田川采文蠃，丈夫封爵名巍峨。\n剖蚝剖蚝且自喜，食贫之家固如此，浣纱亦有西施子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5103,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"项羽","author":"曾逢辰","text":"如貔如虎出江东，救赵先收第一功。\n亚父谋成秦失鹿，陈平计入楚生虫。\n逝骓陔下阵云黑，戏马台前落日红。\n结局终同虞一死，美人薄命累英雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5104,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"破画","author":"曾逢辰","text":"莫誇写照擅专誉，破碎如斯画已虚。\n真笔空传吴子墨，披图难认米家书。\n虎头遗迹留鸿雁，鹅绢残丝恨蠹鱼。\n一幅河山同决裂，倾悬半壁是焚馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5105,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春月","author":"曾逢辰","text":"春光烂漫月黄昏，对影象三酒满樽。\n十里流辉桃叶渡，一轮斜照杏花村。\n欣看兔魄消长夜，不假鳌山作上元。\n掠过秦淮歌舞地，衣香鬓影暗消魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5106,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"管仲","author":"曾逢辰","text":"论人我爱读春秋，仲父多才竟事雠。\n国柄既操忘故主，槛车甫脱献佳猷。\n叔牙知己心能谅，召忽披肝愿莫酬。\n地下若逢公子纠，三归宰相赧颜不。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5107,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠别文枢先生","author":"曾逢辰","text":"避地才归又远离，雪泥鸿爪印天涯。\n鲲洋且击中流楫，驴背叠敲送别诗。\n我盼彼都惊破碎，君归何策解忧危。\n此行自有风云会，力挽狂澜济一时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5108,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"祝栎社廿年纪念","author":"曾逢辰","text":"一代诗人绍建安，廿年牛耳执骚坛。\n司盟星坠中郎老，树帜风高岛佛寒。\n彩律吟成堆锦绣，奚囊贮满呕心肝。\n钵声响彻行云后，追步青莲博大观。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5109,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题李济臣君锄月种梅图","author":"曾逢辰","text":"梅花消瘦證前身，傲骨珊珊自写真。\n争把长镵三尺柄，香分庾岭一枝春。\n雪中荷锸来高士，月下倾樽梦美人。\n我比逋仙尤爱汝，愿移纸阁结芳邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5110,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游新竹青草湖感化堂寻隐者不遇","author":"曾逢辰","text":"彷佛龙冈土一邱，卧龙不起已千秋。\n湖滨旷野开生面，青染孤峰像佛头。\n柳陌游丝曾系马，桐阶落叶乱鸣鸠。\n伊人来去无踪迹，重叠山环小一楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5111,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夷氛","author":"童蒙吉","text":"鸦片筹操帷幄中，戈船巨炮又称雄。\n海隅竞洒苍生泪，两种输他善火攻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5112,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"番头银","author":"童蒙吉","text":"海邦白镪本夷财，个个象形面目开。\n取汝探囊真授首，此曹都已断头来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5113,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"烛泪","author":"黄如许","text":"秋风帘内启芜函，蜡炬当风映酒衫。\n试问成灰乾也否，英雄有泪却仍衔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5114,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"潜园探梅","author":"黄如许","text":"今年春比去年迟，开到园梅客未知。\n涵镜轩前风雪重，捲帘好共看南枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5115,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"破书","author":"黄如许","text":"遗编丛卷有尘埋，破到难堪手细揩。\n借此守残兼抱缺，不妨净几巧安排。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5116,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新居落成","author":"黄如许","text":"作室非关富有馀，免遭风雨足安居。\n家无子敬千囷粟，架只匡衡数卷书。\n砌上苔痕新洗刷，窗前草色未芟除。\n竹城旧雨如相访，好认门联暂息车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5117,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"定寨望洋","author":"黄骧云","text":"此地当年旧战场，我来拾簇吊斜阳。\n城边饮马红毛井，港外飞潮黑水洋。\n一自云屯盘铁瓮，遥连天堑固金汤。\n书生文弱关兵计，贤尹经纶说姓杨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5118,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎岩听竹","author":"黄骧云","text":"虎岩最胜虎邱差，岩胜邱缘竹胜花。\n肖凤鸣声开律祖，学龙吟调谱仙家。\n淇园春半风初到，湘浦秋深月又斜。\n玉版参禅参未了，瓶笙入耳索僧茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5119,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹿港飞帆","author":"黄骧云","text":"太平人唱太平歌，满港舂声欸乃多。\n杨仆功成沙有骨，孙恩死后海无波。\n官军锦舰飞如鸟，估客银帆织似梭。\n寄语边防诸将吏，时虽清晏莫投戈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5120,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙井观泉","author":"黄骧云","text":"龙吸三江并五湖，化为泉水似真珠。\n霖施六合閒仍卧，井养千家润不枯。\n洗我两眶诗眼净，沁人全付热肠无。\n分他一勺龙应许，龙目双睛定识吾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5121,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"笔","author":"郑用鉴","text":"材美东南竹箭遒，胡为屈作管城侯。\n机锋善杀休藏腹，气象能干亦秃头。\n兔变老精逃月窟，麟来衰世涕春秋。\n结绳而治风何古，多事书成鬼哭愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5122,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"墨","author":"郑用鉴","text":"饱饮三升未觉浓，生涯何日不磨中。\n劫烧天地留馀烬，变幻云烟过太空。\n守黑几人能老子，草玄终古耻扬雄。\n文章阴象宜从晦，万丈光芒李杜穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5123,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访友不遇","author":"郑用鉴","text":"白云茅屋隐君家，行尽村园日欲斜。\n不识抱琴何处去，柴门寂寞掩梅花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5124,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岳武穆","author":"郑用鉴","text":"十二金牌发帝宫，尽凭谗舌说元功。\n君臣乐土偷安遂，父子边庭属望空。\n奸恶有心终卖国，昏庸无耻在和戎。\n英灵千载栖霞岭，坟树无枝偃北风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5125,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜友人见过","author":"郑用鉴","text":"茅屋萧萧隐薜萝，故人十载忽相过。\n春风小院花香绕，暮雨寒庭草色多。\n醉后不辞灯下酒，兴来高和郢中歌。\n年衰喜晤忘机友，明日云山奈别何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5126,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读李太白诗","author":"郑用鉴","text":"神仙沦谪不为伤，何惜人间贬夜郎。\n醉眼惊回唐社稷，谁人能识郭汾阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5127,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花 其一","author":"郑用鉴","text":"金盘泣露向黄昏，漠漠东风动画幡。\n此去好归天女手，再来莫作美人魂。\n歌残绛树千声怨，诗比红儿百首冤。\n空抱琵琶弹别泪，伤心桃李总无言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5128,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"落花 其二","author":"郑用鉴","text":"楼台金粉黯模糊，如梦如烟日易晡。\n兰蕙素心沉月露，芙蓉红泪满江湖。\n高烧银烛虫声急，翠掩重门燕影孤。\n夜半花神空叹息，茫茫大化自荣枯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5129,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"严子陵垂钓","author":"郑用鉴","text":"万点云山鸟外青，桐江烟浪昼冥冥。\n故人不遇刘文叔，谁识羊裘是客星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5130,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海市","author":"郑用鉴","text":"蜃楼辉彩耀奇观，词赋元虚叹淼漫。\n雾阁霞窗来恍惚，金支翠羽聚无端。\n虚无物理从兹悟，缥缈仙山下笔难。\n闻道神州接漳浦，有时异境任人看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5131,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"懒","author":"郑用鉴","text":"日长不觉意都灰，怕整衣冠畏客来。\n夜榻未移思月就，晨书偶阅趁风开。\n经旬砚垢无人洗，作答书迟任友催。\n莫笑灌花凭雨到，小庭花木信天栽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5132,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兰","author":"郑用鉴","text":"柔叶吹惠风，芳丛挹清露。\n深谷不逢人，幽香暗中度。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5133,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"郑用鉴","text":"细雨廉纤小院中，凭栏淡冶满芳丛。\n夜深慎莫燃犀照，祇恐阶前有断红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5134,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水阁","author":"郑用鉴","text":"一水当门绿，群峰入座青。\n月摹墙外树，风度草间萤。\n疏柳馀秋色，残荷恋晚馨。\n朱栏池上影，鱼梦漫惊醒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5135,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长剑","author":"郑用鉴","text":"古剑含苍精，床头作龙吼。\n可激烈士心，难容佞臣首。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5136,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"草堂雅集","author":"郑用鉴","text":"主人潇洒爱林泉，坐对湖光兴杳然。\n风月只宜杨子宅，图书多似米家船。\n树浮吴楚山连海，草满汀洲水接天。\n欲载一樽寻旧约，与君同醉白鸥边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5137,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题老子出关图","author":"郑用鉴","text":"华发萧萧两鬓皤，青牛何事此经过。\n昆崙西去黄流远，函谷东来紫气多。\n文字五千存道德，云山万里向沙河。\n当初不是逢关尹，仙迹无闻奈尔何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5138,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送幕客归楚南","author":"郑用鉴","text":"西风萧瑟动酣歌，酒尽阳关去奈何。\n孤棹迥迷杨子渡，片帆遥接洞庭波。\n天涯明月乡心绕，江上青山别恨多。\n惟有长亭分手处，相思无那雁书过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5139,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔笛","author":"郑用鉴","text":"钓罢归来月正明，倚篷三弄海云清。\n西风两岸芦花渚，惊起鸥眠过别汀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5140,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁","author":"郑用鉴","text":"远离朔漠到中州，万里悠悠集侣俦。\n带月影沈湘水夜，叫云声断楚天秋。\n菰田米熟堪充饱，芦渚花深得自由。\n最是客边愁绝处，凄凉飞过夕阳楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5141,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒寿公祠","author":"郑如松","text":"幕府奇男子，临危授命天。\n干戈起蛮触，坏土吊乌鸢。\n此节尽人谅，无官仗汝贤。\n至今留血食，社酒赛年年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5142,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二物吟","author":"郑如恭","text":"造化郁奇气，万珍生奥区。\n不图骇闻见，更在竹与鱼。\n缅彼圆通士，面皱而心虚。\n下有方肠侣，寸寸腹中书。\n葛陂幻颜色，玉水相呴濡。\n此间多妙术，或是仙子居。\n海上异名录，言者人人殊。\n既为我所欲，何可一日无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5143,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北郭烟雨。","author":"郑如兰","text":"酿花时节雨烟笼，浓绿深青衬浅红。\n观稼水田惊鹭起，杖藜人立画图中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5144,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月下看剑 。","author":"郑如兰","text":"空庭如水露团团，斫地高歌把盏看。\n触我雄心齐起舞，霜华气迫月华寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5145,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题武陵桃源图 。","author":"郑如兰","text":"数家鸡犬水云乡，隔断红尘路渺茫。\n洞口桃花自开落，不知人世几沧桑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5146,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叶声 。","author":"郑如兰","text":"万籁萧然景已秋，繁音飞递上高楼。\n庭柯也解伤迟暮，并作西风一夜愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":5147,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]